{
  "name": "photo-lab scelte (Esperimento)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "sticky Giudizio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Giudizio\nLe viste Prova e Studio mandano una risposta alla volta { image_id, task: realism|quality|best, variant, answer, shown, order, tester }. cv-service la accoda a experiments/judgments.csv.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "sticky Tabellone",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Tabellone\nLa vista Esperimento chiede il riepilogo: per ogni workflow quante volte scelto su quante mostrate (intervallo di Wilson), costo, latenza, errori, bocciature del gate, guardie. E la regola di decisione applicata.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Webhook scelta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -40,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "photo-lab-choice",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "*"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Registra giudizio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://cv-service:8000/choices",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 180000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}"
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 8,
      "waitBetweenTries": 15000
    },
    {
      "name": "Rispondi scelta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        440,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
                "value": "*"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Webhook tabellone",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -40,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "photo-lab-summary",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "*"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Riepilogo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "http://cv-service:8000/summary",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 180000
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 8,
      "waitBetweenTries": 15000
    },
    {
      "name": "Rispondi tabellone",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        440,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
                "value": "*"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "sticky Risultato",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -120,
        780
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Risultato\nLa Prova ha ricevuto l'image_id subito; qui chiede ogni 5 s se il record e' pronto. cv-service risponde 404 finche' il prodotto non ha salvato il run, poi le tre schede con le immagini.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Webhook risultato",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -40,
        900
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "photo-lab-result",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "*"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Schede",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        900
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=http://cv-service:8000/runs/{{ $json.query.image_id }}/cards",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rispondi risultato",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        440,
        900
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.ready ? $json : { ready: false }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
                "value": "*"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "sticky Studio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Studio\nLa vista Studio chiede la lista delle foto dello studio cieco (experiments/study-set.txt) e quali hanno gia' le tre versioni pronte.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Webhook studio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1080,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "photo-lab-study",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "*"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Lista studio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "http://cv-service:8000/study",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 180000
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 8,
      "waitBetweenTries": 15000
    },
    {
      "name": "Rispondi studio",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1560,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
                "value": "*"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook scelta": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Registra giudizio",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Registra giudizio": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Rispondi scelta",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Webhook tabellone": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Riepilogo",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Riepilogo": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Rispondi tabellone",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Webhook risultato": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Schede",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Schede": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Rispondi risultato",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Webhook studio": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Lista studio",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Lista studio": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Rispondi studio",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
